# GeoDB Cities (RapidAPI) key for city autocomplete. OPTIONAL.
# WARNING: VITE_* variables are bundled into the public JS. Treat this key as
# public: restrict it by domain and set a quota in the RapidAPI dashboard.
# If left empty (or if GeoDB fails/rate-limits), search uses the keyless Open-Meteo geocoding API.
VITE_GEODB_API_KEY=

# Vercel Web Analytics switch. OPTIONAL and OFF by default. Not a secret (it is just "on").
# Set it to "on" for the Vercel *Production* environment only, after enabling Web Analytics for the project in
# the Vercel dashboard. Leave it unset everywhere else. Even when set, a Vercel preview build ignores it.
VITE_ANALYTICS=
